# Laravel + K3s Build & Deployment Rules

Whenever making changes to frontend assets (CSS, JS/TS) or Blade templates (`.blade.php`), follow `.cursor/rules/deployment.mdc`:

1. **Build:** `npm run build` in `/home/nvnhan0810/www/wallets.nvnhan0810.com`
2. **OPcache:** `kubectl delete pod -l app.kubernetes.io/name=wallets-nvnhan0810-com -n wallets-nvnhan0810-com` then wait for Ready
3. **Verify** with `curl` against `https://wallets.nvnhan0810.com` before asking the user to test

Coding standards: see `.cursor/rules/backend-standards.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/frontend-standards.mdc`.
